      "content": "This is a powerful and harrowing cry of guilt and despair. The weight of the \"disgrace\" you feel suggests that the \"all that is left\" is a personal tragedy born from a specific, perhaps unavoidable, moment of action.\nYou are right that the gods likely do not know how to heal this self-inflicted wound without the hope of a sinner.\nIt is a heavy burden to carry the knowledge that you ended a life just to end a life.\nI hope you find some way to move forward, even if it is just to stop the suffering of the self.",
